# Designed folder is off-limits

Do not create, edit, move, rename, or delete any file or folder under `Designed/` unless the user explicitly asks for changes **inside** `Designed/`.

Main site, payments (N-Genius), and registration live outside `Designed/` — use `api/`, `config/`, `includes/`, `pages/`, `js/`, etc.

If N-Genius or payment configuration is needed, use `config/env.php`, `config/ngenius.secrets.php` (from `config/ngenius.secrets.example.php`), project-root `.env` (see `env.ngenius.example`), or `define()` in `config/env/out_ratib_sa.php` — never `Designed/.env`.
